#: source/features/record_video.rst:4
msgid "Recording Video"
msgstr "录制视频"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:8
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab supports video recording from visualizers and sensor data streams "
"from renderers. Recordings output as ``mp4`` clips."
msgstr "Isaac Lab 支持录制可视化器画面，以及渲染器生成的传感器数据流。录制结果保存为 ``mp4`` 视频片段。"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:22
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:24
msgid "Add a ``VideoRecorderCfg`` to ``env_cfg.video_recorders``:"
msgstr "在 ``env_cfg.video_recorders`` 中添加 ``VideoRecorderCfg`` ："

#: source/features/record_video.rst:34
msgid ""
"Or pass ``--video`` on the command line to record from the default "
"visualizer without editing the environment config:"
msgstr "也可以在命令行中传入 ``--video`` ，无需修改环境配置即可录制默认可视化器的画面："

