msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:0
msgid "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"
msgstr "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:51
msgid ""
"See `Source types`_ for the full list of recordable sources and `Clip "
"control`_ for length and interval options."
