#: source/features/record_video.rst:288
msgid ""
"Configure the recording angle on the visualizer, not the recorder. To open a"
" headless Newton visualizer at a different angle alongside an interactive "
"Kit viewer:"
msgstr "录制视角应在可视化器中配置，而不是在录制器中配置。要在交互式 Kit 查看器之外，另开一个不同视角的无界面 Newton 可视化器："

#: source/features/record_video.rst:304
msgid ""
"Alternatively, use a :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.CameraCfg` sensor in the "
"scene and record with ``source=\"sensor:<name>\"``, which gives full control"
" over the recording viewpoint without requiring a second interactive "
"visualizer."
msgstr ""
"也可以在场景中使用 :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.CameraCfg` 传感器，并通过 "
"``source=\"sensor:<name>\"`` 录制。这样可以完全控制录制视角，无需第二个交互式可视化器。"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:310
msgid "Limitations and compatibility"
msgstr "限制与兼容性"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:312
msgid ""
"``source=\"visualizer:kit\"`` and "
"``source=\"visualizer:kit:streaming_view\"`` require cubric to propagate "
"Newton Fabric scene transforms to the RTX renderer.  Without cubric, a "
"warning is logged and a black-frame warning is emitted at clip write time.  "
"Use ``source=\"visualizer:newton\"`` for guaranteed capture with Newton "
"physics."
msgstr ""
"``source=\"visualizer:kit\"`` 和 ``source=\"visualizer:kit:streaming_view\"``"
" 需要 cubric 将 Newton Fabric 场景变换传递给 RTX 渲染器。未安装 cubric 时会记录警告，并在写入片段时提示黑帧。使用 "
"Newton 物理后端时，可选用 ``source=\"visualizer:newton\"`` 确保能够采集画面。"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:317
msgid ""
"``source=\"visualizer:newton:streaming_view\"`` and "
"``source=\"visualizer:kit:streaming_view\"`` require ``streaming_view=True``"
" on the corresponding visualizer cfg.  A :class:`~RuntimeError` is raised at"
" the first capture attempt if it is not set."
msgstr ""
"``source=\"visualizer:newton:streaming_view\"`` 和 "
"``source=\"visualizer:kit:streaming_view\"`` 要求对应可视化器配置中的 "
"``streaming_view=True`` 。未设置时，首次尝试采集会抛出 :class:`~RuntimeError` 。"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:321
msgid ""
"For ``source=\"sensor:<name>\"``, the named field must exist on the scene "
"config with ``\"rgb\"`` in its ``data_types``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``source=\"sensor:<name>\"`` 时，场景配置中必须存在该名称的字段，且其 ``data_types`` 必须包含 "
"``\"rgb\"`` 。"

