msgstr "✓"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:333
msgid ""
"Headless mode requires ``--enable_cameras`` (or ``ENABLE_CAMERAS=1``) to "
"activate offscreen rendering, or frames are black; ``--video`` sets this "
"automatically when no explicit source is configured."
msgstr ""
"无界面模式需要通过 ``--enable_cameras`` （或 ``ENABLE_CAMERAS=1`` "
"）启用离屏渲染，否则画面为黑色；未配置明确来源时， ``--video`` 会自动启用此选项。"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:336
msgid "``newton_gl``"
msgstr "``newton_gl``"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:338
msgid ""
"Requires an active "
":class:`~isaaclab_visualizers.newton.NewtonGLVisualizerCfg`; uses pyglet's "
"EGL backend and works headlessly without ``--enable_cameras``."
msgstr ""
"需要启用 :class:`~isaaclab_visualizers.newton.NewtonGLVisualizerCfg` ；使用 pyglet "
"的 EGL 后端，无需 ``--enable_cameras`` 即可无界面运行。"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:340
msgid "``newton_rtx``"
msgstr "``newton_rtx``"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:342
msgid ""
"Requires an active "
":class:`~isaaclab_visualizers.newton.NewtonRTXVisualizerCfg` and the OVRTX "
"runtime; capture performs a GPU-to-CPU readback of the path-traced "
"framebuffer."
msgstr ""
"需要启用 :class:`~isaaclab_visualizers.newton.NewtonRTXVisualizerCfg` 并安装 OVRTX "
"运行时；采集时将路径追踪帧缓冲从 GPU 回读到 CPU。"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:344
msgid "``rerun``"
msgstr "``rerun``"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:345 source/features/record_video.rst:349
msgid "✗"
msgstr "✗"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:346
msgid ""
"Remote streaming tool; no local frame-capture API. Passing ``--video`` "
"alongside ``--viz rerun`` raises an error unless another recording-capable "
"visualizer is set."
msgstr ""
"远程流式传输工具，没有本地帧采集 API。将 ``--video`` 与 ``--viz rerun`` "
"配合使用时，如果未设置其他支持录制的可视化器，就会报错。"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:348
msgid "``viser``"
msgstr "``viser``"

#: source/features/record_video.rst:350
msgid ""
"Browser streaming tool; no local frame-capture API. Passing ``--video`` "
"alongside ``--viz viser`` raises an error unless another recording-capable "
"visualizer is set."
msgstr ""
"浏览器流式传输工具，没有本地帧采集 API。将 ``--video`` 与 ``--viz viser`` "
"配合使用时，如果未设置其他支持录制的可视化器，就会报错。"

